references:
  - type: data
    title: "RazorCal: A Compact, Diverse Calibration Corpus for Model Compression"
    authors:
      - name: "RazorCal Contributors"
    abstract: >
      A 2,048-sample, 7-domain calibration corpus released with RAZOR. The
      records carry no architecture-specific fields and suit expert, FFN or
      layer pruning as well as other calibration-based compression. Records
      remain subject to their applicable upstream terms; see data/LICENSE-DATA
      for recorded license information.
